    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hatch, Raise, Fuse: Build the Ultimate Jenin Legion</h2><br>Here, you can hatch and capture a wide variety of Jenin. Through cultivation, fusion, and training with skill books, you can evolve them into their ultimate, most powerful forms. With dozens of unique creatures to collect, you can strategically adjust their formations based on their skills, talents, and attributes to maximize their combat effectiveness. Freely create diverse tactical styles\u2014whether you prefer a high-octane DPS build or a rock-solid defensive counter-attack strategy, you can easily build your dream team!<br><br>Simply sit back and watch your Jenin fight heroically. Even while you're away, you can steadily advance on your epic adventure and conquer the entire Fantasy Idle Dungeon!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424610/extras/61cd578e77b64b3e7bbe5b2b78b3954c.poster.avif?t=1755497491\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424610/extras/61cd578e77b64b3e7bbe5b2b78b3954c.webm?t=1755497491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424610/extras/61cd578e77b64b3e7bbe5b2b78b3954c.mp4?t=1755497491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Your Own Unique Gear</h2><br>Use resources collected in battle to craft exclusive equipment. Through enchanting, refining, and socketing gems, you can upgrade Epic gear into Legendary pieces, unlocking special attributes and bonus effects. Each piece of gear can be tailored to your needs, giving your Jenin unique combat advantages. With strategic use of resources and gear combinations, your legion's strength will continuously grow, allowing you to tackle even more challenging dungeons with ease!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424610/extras/dc2528a023703511fa7d43e684d7c801.poster.avif?t=1755497491\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424610/extras/dc2528a023703511fa7d43e684d7c801.webm?t=1755497491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424610/extras/dc2528a023703511fa7d43e684d7c801.mp4?t=1755497491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Idle Combat, Conquer the Fantasy Idle Dungeon!</h2><br>The mysterious tower, long-sealed ancient ruins, a snowfield frozen for millennia... countless perilous realms await you and your Jenin legion. Take on rewarding Boss Battles with just a single tap to activate idle mode. Sit back and enjoy the show as your Jenin crush all opposition and return in triumph.<br><br>Let everyone witness\u2014you are the true Master of the Fantasy Idle Dungeon<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424610/extras/bd131c6190295b106cbec6b4c2e014db.poster.avif?t=1755497491\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424610/extras/bd131c6190295b106cbec6b4c2e014db.webm?t=1755497491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424610/extras/bd131c6190295b106cbec6b4c2e014db.mp4?t=1755497491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
